            "review_title": "Review at Halal Amin - Pho Muslim",
            "review_text": "AFAK25\nJeddah, Saudi Arabia4492 contributions\n0\nIt's the Pho\nDec 2023 • Couples\nLocated in 'Malaysia Street' next to other Muslim restaurants, Halal Amin specialises in pho and we came especially for this. Having tried Halal commercial versions back home, we want to try the original in the homeland of pho.\n\nI would say the soup is dissimilar to what we have tried before, with a tinge of sweetness and the side serving of Vietnamese basil and an unknown leaves made all the difference. Just wished that they put in more beef slices.\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2023",
