            "review_text": "martinmpbi19\nSurabaya, Indonesia9 contributions\n0\nHalal Amin-Pho Muslim at Ben Thanh Night Market, Ho Chi Minh.\nDec 2019\nThey serve halal foods such as Pho Ba (Beef noodles soup) and Pho Ga (Chicken noodles soup). The noodles is quite over-cooked, that's what I taste, but the soup is tasty and the beef is tender. If you are looking for halal foods, The price is not too pricey. Visit my YouTube Channel for a detail description of the food at mangansekyorek\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2020",
